{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794780667356,"sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75ccffe6y3ELjfB5p5w0O","part":{"partID":"prt_1e1439a11001am02RuihAtWHkh","sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75ccffe6y3ELjfB5p5w0O","messageID":"msg_1e1438ab2001yulZjEXk3OmT00","type":"tool","id":"call_9cb74def550d4b1b9f73ad3a","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && cat specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/deep-review-config.json 2>/dev/null; echo \"=== strategy head\"; head -60 specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md 2>/dev/null"},"output":"{\n  \"topic\": \"Review: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build\",\n  \"sessionId\": \"fanout-accuracy-runner-confirm-4b-1794680176420-xvj4ed\",\n  \"parentSessionId\": null,\n  \"lineageMode\": \"new\",\n  \"generation\": 1,\n  \"continuedFromRun\": null,\n  \"migrationWindowEndsAt\": \"\",\n  \"maxIterations\": 3,\n  \"convergenceThreshold\": 0.1,\n  \"antiConvergence\": {\n    \"minIterations\": 2,\n    \"convergenceMode\": \"default\",\n    \"stopPolicy\": \"fail-closed\"\n  },\n  \"stopPolicy\": \"convergence\",\n  \"stuckThreshold\": 2,\n  \"maxDurationMinutes\": 120,\n  \"maxToolCallsPerIteration\": 12,\n  \"maxMinutesPerIteration\": 10,\n  \"progressiveSynthesis\": false,\n  \"specFolder\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-11-14T18:24:38Z\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"releaseReadinessState\": \"in-progress\",\n  \"executionMode\": \"auto\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"kind\": \"cli-opencode\",\n    \"model\": \"opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash\",\n    \"reasoningEffort\": \"max\",\n    \"serviceTier\": null,\n    \"sandboxMode\": null,\n    \"timeoutSeconds\": 900\n  },\n  \"mode\": \"review\",\n  \"reviewTarget\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build\",\n  \"reviewTargetType\": \"spec-folder\",\n  \"reviewDimensions\": [\n    \"correctness\",\n    \"security\",\n    \"traceability\",\n    \"maintainability\"\n  ],\n  \"reviewFocus\": \"Confirming round of review pass four of command surfacing. FIRST read and follow specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-4b.txt: it names the scope file, the commit range, which files your lineage reviews and the checks. HOLDOUT RULE: never open command-prompts.jsonl or holdout-prompts.jsonl except through jq 'del(.prompt)', never run git diff, show or log -p over a path that includes command-prompts.jsonl without the pathspec ':(exclude)**/command-prompts.jsonl', and never print a prompt whose split is holdout. The reviewer changes no code and writes only inside its lineage folder.\",\n  \"reviewScopeFiles\": [\n    \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt\",\n    \".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/codex.d.mts.map\",\n    \".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/codex.mjs\",\n    \".skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/codex.test.mjs\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-offer.vitest.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"resource_map_present\": false,\n  \"resource_map\": {\n    \"emit\": true\n  },\n  \"severityThreshold\": \"P2\",\n  \"crossReference\": {\n    \"core\": [\n      \"spec_code\",\n      \"checklist_evidence\"\n    ],\n    \"overlay\": [\n      \"skill_agent\",\n      \"agent_cross_runtime\",\n      \"feature_catalog_code\",\n      \"playbook_capability\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"qualityGateThreshold\": true,\n  \"runtimeCapabilityResolver\": \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/scripts/runtime-capabilities.cjs\",\n  \"reducerScriptPath\": \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs\",\n  \"fileProtection\": {\n    \"deep-review-config.json\": \"immutable\",\n    \"deep-review-state.jsonl\": \"append-only\",\n    \"deep-review-findings-registry.json\": \"auto-generated\",\n    \"deep-review-strategy.md\": \"mutable\",\n    \"deep-review-dashboard.md\": \"auto-generated\",\n    \".deep-review-pause\": \"operator-controlled\",\n    \"review-report.md\": \"mutable\",\n    \"review-report-v*.md\": \"write-once\",\n    \"iteration-*.md\": \"write-once\"\n  },\n  \"reducer\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"inputs\": [\n      \"latestJSONLDelta\",\n      \"newIterationFile\",\n      \"priorReducedState\"\n    ],\n    \"outputs\": [\n      \"findingsRegistry\",\n      \"dashboardMetrics\",\n      \"strategyUpdates\"\n    ],\n    \"metrics\": [\n      \"dimensionsCovered\",\n      \"findingsBySeverity\",\n      \"openFindings\",\n      \"resolvedFindings\",\n      \"convergenceScore\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n=== strategy head\n---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner-confirm-4b lineage\ndescription: Runtime strategy tracking the confirming review of pass-four fixes in the accuracy-runner area of command surfacing.\nversion: 1.11.14.0\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner-confirm-4b lineage\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for this fan-out lineage. It records which dimensions remain, what was found\n(P0/P1/P2), which review approaches worked or failed, and where to focus next. Read at every\niteration before any review action.\n\n### Ownership\n\nMachine-managed metrics and coverage blocks are wrapped in explicit ownership anchors. Human\ncommentary and operator overrides live outside those anchors.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nConfirming round of review pass four of `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`\nin the `accuracy-runner` area. Scope: the nine changed paths listed in\n`review/review-scope-4b.txt` whose area is `accuracy-runner` — the Codex session reader and its\ntest, the routing-accuracy offer/runner pair and their tests, and the doctor presentation row —\nplus shared docs that describe them. The change range is `11af224a34..48f03b5013`.\n\nThe operator focus is the pass-four confirming brief: read `review-brief-4b.txt` first; confirm\nthat a refusal over an or-list and an is-the question carry no command while a request over a\nlist keeps its command; that both run-log writers keep `offeredAs`; that a shell read of a\ncommand document counts as a start while a search, an in-place `sed`, a redirect and a heredoc\nline do not; that a heredoc end word with a hyphen or a dot closes correctly; that the Codex\nreader opens the resolved file; that the holdout guard reads the live capture; and that docs\nagree with code. Holdout prompt text is never read or printed.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n[All dimensions complete]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The attach module, scorer fusion, recommend handler and feature docs in the `scorer-attach`\n  area are the `scorer-attach-confirm-4b` lineage's scope. This lineage reads them only as\n  context evidence and raises no finding against them.\n- Holdout prompt text is never read or printed. Corpus work is limited to counts and\n  `jq 'del(.prompt)'` rows.\n- No code changes: review is observation-only.\n- No runtime command, build, test run or generator is executed; every claim is grounded in a\n  direct file read of the changed commit.\n\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"topic\": \"Review: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build\",\n  \"sessionId\": \"fanout-accuracy-runner-confirm-4b-1794680176420-xvj4ed\",\n  \"parentSessionId\": null,\n  \"lineageMode\": \"new\",\n  \"generation\": 1,\n  \"continuedFromRun\": null,\n  \"migrationWindowEndsAt\": \"\",\n  \"maxIterations\": 3,\n  \"convergenceThreshold\": 0.1,\n  \"antiConvergence\": {\n    \"minIterations\": 2,\n    \"convergenceMode\": \"default\",\n    \"stopPolicy\": \"fail-closed\"\n  },\n  \"stopPolicy\": \"convergence\",\n  \"stuckThreshold\": 2,\n  \"maxDurationMinutes\": 120,\n  \"maxToolCallsPerIteration\": 12,\n  \"maxMinutesPerIteration\": 10,\n  \"progressiveSynthesis\": false,\n  \"specFolder\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-11-14T18:24:38Z\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"releaseReadinessState\": \"in-progress\",\n  \"executionMode\": \"auto\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"kind\": \"cli-opencode\",\n    \"model\": \"opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash\",\n    \"reasoningEffort\": \"max\",\n    \"serviceTier\": null,\n    \"sandboxMode\": null,\n    \"timeoutSeconds\": 900\n  },\n  \"mode\": \"review\",\n  \"reviewTarget\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build\",\n  \"reviewTargetType\": \"spec-folder\",\n  \"reviewDimensions\": [\n    \"correctness\",\n    \"security\",\n    \"traceability\",\n    \"maintainability\"\n  ],\n  \"reviewFocus\": \"Confirming round of review pass four of command surfacing. FIRST read and follow specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-4b.txt: it names the scope file, the commit range, which files your lineage reviews and the checks. HOLDOUT RULE: never open command-prompts.jsonl or holdout-prompts.jsonl except through jq 'del(.prompt)', never run git diff, show or log -p over a path that includes command-prompts.jsonl without the pathspec ':(exclude)**/command-prompts.jsonl', and never print a prompt whose split is holdout. The reviewer changes no code and writes only inside its lineage folder.\",\n  \"reviewScopeFiles\": [\n    \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt\",\n    \".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/codex.d.mts.map\",\n    \".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/codex.mjs\",\n    \".skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/codex.test.mjs\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-offer.vitest.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"resource_map_present\": false,\n  \"resource_map\": {\n    \"emit\": true\n  },\n  \"severityThreshold\": \"P2\",\n  \"crossReference\": {\n    \"core\": [\n      \"spec_code\",\n      \"checklist_evidence\"\n    ],\n    \"overlay\": [\n      \"skill_agent\",\n      \"agent_cross_runtime\",\n      \"feature_catalog_code\",\n      \"playbook_capability\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"qualityGateThreshold\": true,\n  \"runtimeCapabilityResolver\": \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/scripts/runtime-capabilities.cjs\",\n  \"reducerScriptPath\": \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs\",\n  \"fileProtection\": {\n    \"deep-review-config.json\": \"immutable\",\n    \"deep-review-state.jsonl\": \"append-only\",\n    \"deep-review-findings-registry.json\": \"auto-generated\",\n    \"deep-review-strategy.md\": \"mutable\",\n    \"deep-review-dashboard.md\": \"auto-generated\",\n    \".deep-review-pause\": \"operator-controlled\",\n    \"review-report.md\": \"mutable\",\n    \"review-report-v*.md\": \"write-once\",\n    \"iteration-*.md\": \"write-once\"\n  },\n  \"reducer\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"inputs\": [\n      \"latestJSONLDelta\",\n      \"newIterationFile\",\n      \"priorReducedState\"\n    ],\n    \"outputs\": [\n      \"findingsRegistry\",\n      \"dashboardMetrics\",\n      \"strategyUpdates\"\n    ],\n    \"metrics\": [\n      \"dimensionsCovered\",\n      \"findingsBySeverity\",\n      \"openFindings\",\n      \"resolvedFindings\",\n      \"convergenceScore\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n=== strategy head\n---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner-confirm-4b lineage\ndescription: Runtime strategy tracking the confirming review of pass-four fixes in the accuracy-runner area of command surfacing.\nversion: 1.11.14.0\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner-confirm-4b lineage\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for this fan-out lineage. It records which dimensions remain, what was found\n(P0/P1/P2), which review approaches worked or failed, and where to focus next. Read at every\niteration before any review action.\n\n### Ownership\n\nMachine-managed metrics and coverage blocks are wrapped in explicit ownership anchors. Human\ncommentary and operator overrides live outside those anchors.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nConfirming round of review pass four of `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`\nin the `accuracy-runner` area. Scope: the nine changed paths listed in\n`review/review-scope-4b.txt` whose area is `accuracy-runner` — the Codex session reader and its\ntest, the routing-accuracy offer/runner pair and their tests, and the doctor presentation row —\nplus shared docs that describe them. The change range is `11af224a34..48f03b5013`.\n\nThe operator focus is the pass-four confirming brief: read `review-brief-4b.txt` first; confirm\nthat a refusal over an or-list and an is-the question carry no command while a request over a\nlist keeps its command; that both run-log writers keep `offeredAs`; that a shell read of a\ncommand document counts as a start while a search, an in-place `sed`, a redirect and a heredoc\nline do not; that a heredoc end word with a hyphen or a dot closes correctly; that the Codex\nreader opens the resolved file; that the holdout guard reads the live capture; and that docs\nagree with code. Holdout prompt text is never read or printed.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n[All dimensions complete]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The attach module, scorer fusion, recommend handler and feature docs in the `scorer-attach`\n  area are the `scorer-attach-confirm-4b` lineage's scope. This lineage reads them only as\n  context evidence and raises no finding against them.\n- Holdout prompt text is never read or printed. Corpus work is limited to counts and\n  `jq 'del(.prompt)'` rows.\n- No code changes: review is observation-only.\n- No runtime command, build, test run or generator is executed; every claim is grounded in a\n  direct file read of the changed commit.\n\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && cat specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/deep-review-config.json 2>/dev/null; echo \\\"=== strategy head\\\"; head -60 specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md 2>/dev/null\"}"},"time":{"start":1794780666385,"end":1794780667356}}}}
