{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794782095238,"sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75ccffe6y3ELjfB5p5w0O","part":{"partID":"prt_1e15957c7001Tnryn233kmYXnX","sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75ccffe6y3ELjfB5p5w0O","messageID":"msg_1e1592f25001y05KQZBltSLkoy","type":"tool","id":"call_9d7adf39fc984cab9165be82","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Three iterations, each recorded through the append gateway (exit 0, ledger sequences 1-3) with a\n  delta file and a strategy update; the reducer ran after each and reports 8 open findings, 0\n  resolved, convergence score 0.75 at the terminal stop. The synthesis close-out staged\n  `deep_review.synthesis_complete` and the gateway recorded it as ledger sequence 4, after which the\n  reducer reports `status: COMPLETE`, `stopReason: maxIterationsReached` and full dimension coverage.\n- Deviation recorded: the run-opening config row is the `deep-review-config.json` file the reducer\n  reads, not a ledger `config` event. The gateway refuses a bare config object (\"expected object with\n  stem or event_type\"), and the canonical `deep_review.run_initialized` payload needs a target\n  reference, a convergence policy version and a review-contract digest this process cannot compute\n  without fabricating them, so the draft `config.event.json` was left unappended.\n- No code, test, config, registry, dashboard or shared doc was modified. Writes stayed inside the\n  lineage directory: `deep-review-config.json`, `deep-review-strategy.md`, the three iteration\n  narratives, the three delta files, the three record files, the synthesis event file and this report.\n- No prompt corpus file was opened; no model session, build or daemon ran.","oldString":"- Three iterations, each recorded through the append gateway (exit 0, ledger sequences 1-3) with a\n  delta file and a strategy update; the reducer ran after each and reports 8 open findings, 0\n  resolved, convergence score 0.75 at the terminal stop.\n- No code, test, config, registry, dashboard or shared doc was modified. Writes stayed inside the\n  lineage directory: `deep-review-config.json`, `deep-review-strategy.md`, the three iteration\n  narratives, the three delta files, the three record files and this report.\n- No prompt corpus file was opened; no model session, build or daemon ran.","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-5b/review-report.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-5b/review-report.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-5b/review-report.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-5b/review-report.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-5b/review-report.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-5b/review-report.md\n@@ -125,9 +125,16 @@\n ## 10. Audit Appendix\n \n - Three iterations, each recorded through the append gateway (exit 0, ledger sequences 1-3) with a\n   delta file and a strategy update; the reducer ran after each and reports 8 open findings, 0\n-  resolved, convergence score 0.75 at the terminal stop.\n+  resolved, convergence score 0.75 at the terminal stop. The synthesis close-out staged\n+  `deep_review.synthesis_complete` and the gateway recorded it as ledger sequence 4, after which the\n+  reducer reports `status: COMPLETE`, `stopReason: maxIterationsReached` and full dimension coverage.\n+- Deviation recorded: the run-opening config row is the `deep-review-config.json` file the reducer\n+  reads, not a ledger `config` event. The gateway refuses a bare config object (\"expected object with\n+  stem or event_type\"), and the canonical `deep_review.run_initialized` payload needs a target\n+  reference, a convergence policy version and a review-contract digest this process cannot compute\n+  without fabricating them, so the draft `config.event.json` was left unappended.\n - No code, test, config, registry, dashboard or shared doc was modified. Writes stayed inside the\n   lineage directory: `deep-review-config.json`, `deep-review-strategy.md`, the three iteration\n-  narratives, the three delta files, the three record files and this report.\n+  narratives, the three delta files, the three record files, the synthesis event file and this report.\n - No prompt corpus file was opened; no model session, build or daemon ran.\n","status":"modified","additions":9,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-5b/review-report.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Three iterations, each recorded through the append gateway (exit 0, ledger sequences 1-3) with a\\n  delta file and a strategy update; the reducer ran after each and reports 8 open findings, 0\\n  resolved, convergence score 0.75 at the terminal stop. The synthesis close-out staged\\n  `deep_review.synthesis_complete` and the gateway recorded it as ledger sequence 4, after which the\\n  reducer reports `status: COMPLETE`, `stopReason: maxIterationsReached` and full dimension coverage.\\n- Deviation recorded: the run-opening config row is the `deep-review-config.json` file the reducer\\n  reads, not a ledger `config` event. The gateway refuses a bare config object (\\\"expected object with\\n  stem or event_type\\\"), and the canonical `deep_review.run_init