{"type":"text","timestamp":1794782120246,"sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75ccffe6y3ELjfB5p5w0O","part":{"id":"prt_1e159b613002VWqcgUSvRkGCm0","sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75ccffe6y3ELjfB5p5w0O","messageID":"msg_1e159a5af001nf16oiABUTOjDG","type":"text","text":"Lineage complete. Summary of what this detached worker did:\n\n**Setup** — Read `review-brief-5b.txt`, `review-scope-5b.txt` (area `accuracy-runner`), `review/verify-5/report.md`, plan D13 and the report-2/report-3 limits before any review action. No prompt corpus file was opened; no code, test or shared doc was touched.\n\n**Iterations (3 of 3, all recorded through the append gateway, delta written, reducer run after each)**\n1. **correctness** — write reader and `COMMAND:` reader, probed in memory on 31 shell spellings and 20 marker spellings. 4 × P2: `--target-directory` names the source (and a scratch source lets the in-checkout write be discarded), a bare `&` is folded into a writer's args, a 3-backtick line closes a 4-backtick fence, and `git rm`/`install`/`truncate` stay invisible.\n2. **security** — arena provenance refusals (dirty, stale, escaping/absolute/dangling link, JSON line on every failed check) and the every-turn guard with `GIT_ALLOW_PROTOCOL=file` + credential overrides. 2 × P2: `turnRefusal` can throw where its contract promises a refusal, and a mid-arm refusal names no row.\n3. **traceability / maintainability** — parent spec phase row, lane A task rows, README rows against code. 2 × P2: the `symlink_escape` clause omits the dangling-link refusal, and the scorer row never says an in-place shell edit is a write.\n\n**Terminal state** — Verdict **PASS with advisories** (0 P0, 0 P1, 8 P2); registry `COMPLETE`, stop reason `maxIterationsReached`, dimension coverage 1.0; `review-report.md`, dashboard and strategy all agree. The one recorded deviation: the run-opening config row is the config file the reducer reads, not a ledger event — the gateway refuses a bare config object and the canonical `run_initialized` payload needs digests this process cannot compute without fabricating them.\n\nFANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:accuracy-runner-confirm-5b","time":{"start":1794782115347,"end":1794782120246}}}
